h\" ><strong>Adapt</strong> after every mission with new cards, upgrades, and hard choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 FEATURES</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based tactical combat</strong> with unit positioning, movement, and range</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deckbuilding with roguelite progression</strong> \u2013 every mission matters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower defense </strong>\u2013 defend against escalating demonic waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, intense missions</strong> \u2013 5\u201310 minutes per battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-crafted pixel art</strong> in a grimdark war-torn world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No RNG</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682750/extras/3e7aaccb3565f4c2a290b2bfeef89f5c.poster.avif?t=1769427838\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682750/extras/3e7aaccb3565f4c2a290b2bfeef89f5c.webm?t=1769427838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682750/extras/3e7aaccb3565f4c2a290b2bfeef89f5c.mp4?t=1769427838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the Great War shattered the world, the earth split open. Levitating obelisks rose from scorched ground \u2014 massive, silent, and humming with infernal energy.\u00a0 From them came the <i>Fallen</i>. Demonic. Unstoppable. Without mercy. They swept across what remained of mankind. Now, only one stronghold endures: Arx Ultima. You are the final commander. Deploy your deck. Defend the bastion. Survive the siege. Or be erased with the rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of Urtuk: The Desolation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["David Kaleta","Lukas Svrcek"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682750/f5caefc00c09a38cc7b8f472b2956a05bfd97f99/header.jpg?t=1769427838","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3682750/884207/2393fff859484438488b4aa1bfd42ddbda8e5f8d/1750400995/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746623218","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3682750/884207/2393fff859484438488b4aa1bfd42ddbda8e5f8d/1750400995/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746623218","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3682750/884207/2393fff859484438488b4aa1bfd42ddbda8e5f8d/1750400995/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746623218","id":257134956,"name":"gameplay1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257134956/bb0981b0a86e5d69a1d4a4cf5c412ec63f97086e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746623218"}],"name":"Echo Bastion","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["David Kaleta"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s